    <p>
      My background is primarily technical and still hands-on:
      endpoint security, EDR/XDR/MDR, detection, incident analysis,
      security architecture, networking, SIEM/SOAR and some ICS/OT.
    </p>

    <h2>Selected credentials</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GIAC GMON</li>
      <li>GIAC GRID</li>
      <li>GIAC Advisory Board</li>
      <li>OSCP since 2010</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
